Read-only audit of /Users/sashaabramovich/live-spec. Do NOT edit. Return ≤700 words: ledger rows in EXACTLY this format, citing SOURCE (file + heading + line):
`capability | canonical owner | anchor | input | output | boundary ("does not do") | invocation/route | proof | state(working/partial/prose-only/stale)`

Domain: skill lifecycle, skill-creator/evals, external-skill installation/sync. Rows:
1. skill-review records (docs/skill-review/ — count, dates, what produced them: was an actual skill-creator adapter/tool executed, or are they hand-written reviews? Read the newest one's header);
2. skill-review push gate (guardrails/check-skill-review.sh:128 — grep -qw name matching, ROADMAP row 607 defect);
3. evals (evals/ + docs/evals/ — enumerate, e.g. build-pipeline.md, 2026-07-23-text-audit; which are scored, which unscored — row 562);
4. per-finding disposition — is there ANY mechanism recording each review finding's disposition (fixed/declined)? (docs/skill-review/ files, ROADMAP rows born from findings) or none;
5. external skill install (scripts/install-external-skills.sh — clone, floor check :34-38,:50-63, silent `|| true` pull :44);
6. installed-copy staleness class (Req 275:6605, check-config-health skill-copy arm :91-111, M-336 stale prose);
7. mirror sync (scripts/sync-mirrors.sh — editions/ mirror, REFUSAL_STALE mtime guard :122, prover fence :434-441);
8. dev-machine skill sync (scripts/sync-skills.sh — NO .git fence yet, C-K4 pending);
9. installer (install.sh:20-38 — .git skip :22, timestamped attic backup);
10. version stamping (scripts/stamp-versions.py, test_version_is_one_fact);
11. rollback of an installed skill — mechanism or none (attic write-only).
Boundary + flags: duplicate authorities (skills/ vs editions/ vs external repo); described-but-not-invoked; lighter-route candidates. Proof: real-run tests vs string-only per row.

